SUMMARY:Just Feel it! Vogue Nights
DESCRIPTION:May 21\, 2026  // 9pm // $15\nall prices + fees\nBUY TICKETS \nToronto\, it’s time! <3 \nJust Feel It is Toronto’s first consistent OTA vogue night run entirely by the dolls\, launching monthly only at Buddies in Bad Times Theatre. Organized by Milani Telfar (@akamilani)\, this is a night built for the Black and Brown queer community\, the ballroom scene\, and everyone who wants to witness something real happening in the Village. \nWalk the categories\, watch the legends\, feel the room. \nWHEN: \nThursday May 21st | 9PM – 1AM | LSS 9:45PM | $15 | 19+ \nCATEGORIES: \nOTA Runway \nBaby Vogue \nOTA Face \nRealness \nBody \nOTA Performance ($200 cash prize) \n  \n  \nIf you wish to sponsor a prize for a category\, please reach out to the organizer directly. \n  \nMC: Princess Danielle Siriano (@danielle.lastres) \nDJ: Legendary Canada Father Pleasure Juicy Couture (@djpleasure) \n  \nTickets available at the door and online. \nxoxo\, Milani
URL:https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/just-feel-it-vogue-nights/
LOCATION:Tallulahs
END:VEVENT
