LAST-MODIFIED:20260508T151238Z
UID:10002518-1779573600-1779573600@buddiesinbadtimes.com
SUMMARY:FROCIO!
DESCRIPTION:May 23\, 2026 // 10PM // $5 – $15\nall prices + fees \nBUY TICKETS\n\n🪩 Ladies\, gentle-them and sciuras….. please welcome back our bi-monthly f*🐐y Italo-Disco party…. FROCIOOOOOOOO! 🪩 \nThis time I promise we will have MORE Italian music\, Italian-isms and maybe\, just maybe\, my Italian ex will show up. \nThis is an 80’s forward Italo Disco party with sounds from the old (and some new) end of the world! From cheap drum machines with romantic analog synths elevated by the vocals of your favourite Italian diva singers to modern day Italian radio pop hits 💿💋 \nAs we get ready for summer (I’m wondering if she’ll ever come)\, join us with our signature Campari spritz drink and let’s warm up the season ourselves ⛱️🍹! \nThis edition of FROCIO! is brought to you sonically by Aeryn Pfaff\, Rose Hips & the iconic Automaticamore. With a special performance by Rosacea Cheeks! \nOh and in case you were wondering\, “Frocio” means f*g*ot in Italian. \n  \n 
URL:https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/frocio-2/
LOCATION:Tallulahs
END:VEVENT
