SUMMARY:Wink: White Lie Party
DESCRIPTION:May 30\, 2026  // 10pm // $15 – $20\n$10 Discount for BIPOC with code: WINKBIPOC\nBUY TICKETS \n \nCalling all the Toronto Lesbians!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! \nWink the lesbian party is back\, and this time we’re here with a new theme. Did you know lying is the most fun a Lesbian can have without taking their clothes off???? Come out to Wink and prove if that’s really true. Grab a white shirt\, write your best lie on it\, and let the flirting\, fun\, and confusion begin. Whether you’re “emotionally available\,” “over your ex\,” or “just here for one drink\,” we want to see it. Make us believe you are what you say you are\, just for one night. Wink is for people who love dancing\, getting sweaty\, hot lesbians\, good music\, and a room full of beautiful liars.
URL:https://buddiesinbadtimes.com/event/wink-white-lie-party/
LOCATION:Tallulahs
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR